#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:8
msgid "为已有芯片接入 Board"
msgstr "Add a Board for an existing chip"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:10
msgid ""
"仅在完整料号已有 provider 时走这条路径。Board 增加 PCB、晶振、电源、引脚、外部 器件和安全初始电平事实，不复制 "
"HAL，不授权芯片的全部可用路线。"
msgstr ""
"Use this path only when a provider already maintains the full part. A Board "
"adds PCB, oscillator, power, pin, external-device and safe initial-level "
"facts. It does not copy the HAL or authorize every available silicon route."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:13
msgid "准备最小事实"
msgstr "Prepare minimal facts"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:15
msgid ""
"记录完整料号和封装、PCB／原理图／BOM 版本、来源、晶振、供电、SWD 预留、跳线、 "
"引脚与有效电平。先接一个状态输出和一个串口；未观测的修订、桥接与电气条件保持 未知。晶振值不能自动合成新的 PLL、Flash latency "
"或外设内核时钟方案。"
msgstr ""
"Record the full part and package, PCB/schematic/BOM revisions, provenance, "
"oscillators, supply, SWD reservations, jumpers, pins and active levels. "
"Start with one status output and one serial port. Unobserved revisions, "
"bridges and electrical conditions remain unknown. An oscillator value cannot"
" automatically synthesize a new PLL, Flash-latency or peripheral kernel-"
"clock plan."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:19
msgid ""
"公共可复用 Board 位于 `boards/`，私有 PCB 包由产品仓库维护。普通包只需 `board.json` 和简短 "
"README；无法由现有数据表达的电气行为才增加受限的 C hook。"
msgstr ""
"Public reusable Boards live in `boards/`; products maintain private PCB "
"packages in their repositories. An ordinary package needs only `board.json` "
"and a short README. Add bounded C hooks only for electrical behavior that "
"existing data cannot express."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:22
msgid "维护的完整 Board 输入；文档来源与实际 PCB 观测分开。"
msgstr ""
"Complete maintained Board input; document provenance and actual PCB "
"observations are separate."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:27
msgid "创建外部装配"
msgstr "Create an external assembly"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:29
msgid "以下为命令模板；先将包路径、时钟和 binding 替换为实际审核的值："
msgstr ""
"The following is a command template. First replace package paths, clock and "
"binding with the actually reviewed values:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:40
msgid ""
"`--board` 与 `--board-package` 二选一。命令行包路径相对工作目录，生成 TOML 中的 包路径相对该 "
"TOML，移动整个产品目录可保留关系。路径不能通过 symlink 逃逸。 `provider-check` 解析同一 typed IR 并生成实际静态"
" bundle，记录所选 part、Board、 后端、控制器与输入身份；此时尚未编译。"
msgstr ""
"Select exactly one of `--board` and `--board-package`. A command-line "
"package path is relative to the working directory; its path in generated "
"TOML is relative to that TOML, so moving the entire product directory can "
"preserve the relationship. Paths cannot escape through symlinks. `provider-"
"check` resolves the same typed IR and generates a real static bundle, "
"recording selected part, Board, backend, controllers and input identities. "
"No compilation has occurred yet."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:45
msgid "编译完整消费者"
msgstr "Build a complete consumer"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:47
msgid ""
"在自己的完整 CMake 应用中选择该 `assembly.toml`，按[CMake 接入](cmake-consumption.md) "
"使用所选源码和 ARM 工具链。可先复制维护的对应 F407 starter，只修改自己的 Board 引用与实际选择，保留应用源和静态存储："
msgstr ""
"Select that `assembly.toml` in your own complete CMake application. Follow "
"[CMake integration](cmake-consumption.md) with the chosen source and ARM "
"toolchain. You may first copy the corresponding maintained F407 starter, "
"change only your Board reference and actual selections, and retain "
"application source and static storage:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:58
msgid ""
"核对实际 part、向量、IRQ、链接 RAM／Flash 和资源报告。裸机与 FreeRTOS 使用独立 "
"构建目录。配置拒绝时修改作者输入，不改生成输出或静默选别的引脚。"
msgstr ""
"Check the actual part, vectors, IRQs, linked RAM/Flash and resource report. "
"Use separate build directories for baremetal and FreeRTOS. When "
"configuration rejects input, change the author input; do not edit generated "
"output or silently select different pins."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/board-porting.md:61
msgid ""
"Board 字段与绑定格式见[接入合同](../reference/contracts/integration.md)。实际接入 设备后再按[HIL "
"流程](performance-hil.md)绑定 PCB、part／UID、探针、接线、镜像和 "
"测量；源文件中的硅片路线不能证明连接器连通性或电气安全。"
msgstr ""
"See the [integration contract](../reference/contracts/integration.md) for "
"Board fields and binding formats. After connecting real equipment, follow "
"the [HIL workflow](performance-hil.md) to bind PCB, part/UID, probe, wiring,"
" image and measurements. Silicon routes in source files do not establish "
"connector continuity or electrical safety."
